    "brief": "Wasp example 19: field-driven series continued",
    "principle": "\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 20 (wasp_20) directly continues the field-driven series from tutorial 19, further developing field-driven aggregation with mesh-based and constraint-based techniques alongside the established scalar-field biased-growth, voxel-based, and parametric-assembly strategies. Tutorial 19 is a direct prerequisite for tutorial 20, and the two share closely related content around field-driven discrete assembly with isoline, attribute-based, and 3d-populate workflows.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 21 (wasp_21) continues beyond tutorial 20 but advances into a new topic series, confirming the field-driven series concludes at tutorial 20. Tutorial 19 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 21 via tutorial 20.\n\nRelated insight: \n\nRelated insight: Tutorial 24 (wasp_24) continues the new topic series beyond tutorial 23, further confirming the field-driven series concludes at tutorial 20. Tutorial 19 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 24 via tutorials 20, 21, 22, and 23.",
